  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Adults <strong>MUST</strong> shoot longbows (not because we don’t like recurves, but because the longbow is the reason why this organization exists and why we gather at this event)</p></li></ul><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">No rangefinders or binoculars allowed in competition.</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">All arrow types are welcome</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Kids 15 and under shoot free (must be accompanied by an adult)</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Camping and food vendors available</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Boating, fishing, and swimming in beautiful Thornapple Lake</p></li></ul></div>


  








