  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">An area designated specifically for the pre-teen crowd. Adult supervised with a large variety of targets. Don’t worry if your child does not have their own equipment. We will have bows and arrows on hand for this shooting station and an experienced MLA volunteer will always be on hand to provide assistance or advice.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">THE RON LACLAIR BUCKSKIN BOWMAN CHALLENGE</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">You have to be able to do it all in this one. MLA legend Ron, LaClair wasn’t just an archer, he was a woodsman through-and-throgh. A throwback to a different time. This one has it all, trick-shooting, knife throwing, and tomahawk chuckery. Whether you just want to experience something new or want to be the best-of-the-best in honor of Ron, you don’t want to miss this one. Watching it is a blast.</p><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">YOUTH SILVER ARROW</h3></div>


  








