  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Test your skill at hitting stationary clay pigeons in succession. This competition runs Friday and Saturday with a shoot off on Saturday afternoon to determine who is the best. A board with the event's top shooters is displayed with the best of the best on top for the world to see. The top shooter will receive an award arrow and all the bragging rights that come with.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">This event is held in honor of longtime member and MLA Legend Denny “Ol’ Sagamore” Every.</p></div>


  








